1
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,277
This...

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,340
this can't be!

3
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,230
Oh...

4
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,820
I didn't see him with the mask.

5
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,557
I didn't know that he
had it anywhere near him.

6
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:37,160
I didn't see him put in the red stone.

7
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:40,040
No, it can't be. Dear God.

8
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,790
Kars.

9
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,420
Ah, ah, ah, ah!

10
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:22,060
Shijima no soko kara

11
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,940
Thank you.

12
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:49,260
Oh

13
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,100
He'll stood up again, Major!

14
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:02,017
You're the fatherland's cream of the crop!

15
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:04,571
You will stand your ground no matter what!

16
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:14,940
He has become the uber-mensch! Can it be?

17
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:19,237
I thought no creature could
attain perfection, but now...

18
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,740
Damn you!

19
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,320
See that?

20
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:23,980
How his arm is burning?

21
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,877
Maybe we don't have to
fight perfection after all!

22
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,640
Harmon melts his accursed flesh even now!

23
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:33,017
In another minute, there
will be nothing left of him!

24
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:36,200
He has lusted after the
Red Stone for millennia,

25
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:40,580
but when it is all said and done,
his quest for immortality has failed!

26
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:44,280
You will perish knowing
that you are a failure!

27
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:48,797
Ready the UV amplifier for another shot!

28
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:52,100
One direct hit should be
enough to finish him off.

29
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,260
Hurry it up, soldier! Yabble!

30
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,240
What's he doing?

31
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,991
Looks like he's thinking.

32
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:20,520
Staring at a damn squirrel, what the hell?

33
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,800
Look, Mr. Speedwagon!

34
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:25,200
His hand, it's changing!

35
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:31,660
I've seen some crazy stuff, but this...

36
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,557
It's his hands on the red stone.

37
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:44,934
First thing he does is make a squirrel.

38
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:50,530
Oh, hey.

39
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,080
Look at that.

40
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:53,829
I think he found a friend.

41
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:55,850
Hey, squirrel!

42
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,477
Get away from that thing!

43
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,678
You don't know the guy it's made of!

44
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:10,060
Ha, ha, ha!

45
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,000
Spurly coming!

46
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:19,180
Soldiers!

47
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,280
Full retreat!

48
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,440
My God!

49
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,460
He has complete mastery over organic life!

50
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,240
All right!

51
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,180
The sun is rising!

52
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,660
Not a one of them left alive.

53
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,311
Kars is about to get what's coming to him.

54
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,580
Thank goodness.

55
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,230
How?

56
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:15,540
Think again.

57
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,040
He's feeling fine.

58
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,957
He's standing in the morning sun.

59
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:21,680
And he couldn't care less about it!

60
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,110
Jojo!

61
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:32,980
This is a horrible
nightmare! We're doomed!

62
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,280
This is the day all of us die!

63
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:37,080
Humanity's done for!

64
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:41,680
Alpha and Omega both.

65
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:45,511
I am the pinnacle of all life
that has ever trod the Earth.

66
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,817
All of their forms are mine to take.

67
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:52,960
And you, my old nemesis, I
see how entrancing you are.

68
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:56,317
Yours is a beauty the likes
of which I have never seen.

69
00:06:56,400 --> 00:07:01,580
I once feared you, but
now I fear you no more.

70
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,820
Kars, he's become invincible.

71
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,820
He has no weaknesses now.

72
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,517
He even shrugs off
Harmon like it's nothing.

73
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,820
He's won, and he knows it.

74
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,628
You can see it in his eyes.

75
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,280
Cars the pillar man is no more!

76
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:21,040
He's become Cars the ultimate creation!

77
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,360
This is all my fault.

78
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:28,776
I'm the one who hit him with the UV
after he put on the completed mask.

79
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,950
Is...

80
00:07:30,033 --> 00:07:31,757
is there really no way to stop him, Mr.

81
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,670
Speedwagon?

82
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,160
He's so strong now!

83
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:37,576
We're all gonna be food for
this walking museum piece!

84
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:43,560
Now, I've got a plan, huh?

85
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:46,360
Did I hear you right, Jojo?

86
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,910
Hold her.

87
00:07:49,993 --> 00:07:50,823
Uh-huh.

88
00:07:50,906 --> 00:07:53,080
One last all-or-nothing gambit!

89
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,600
All-or-nothing gambit, you say?

90
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,580
Yeah, it's my final move.

91
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,220
What does it involve?

92
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:05,540
Jojo, when you say final move, you're not
referring to that final move, are you?

93
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:06,790
Listen up!

94
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,397
This is something you're going
to have to do for yourself!

95
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:12,774
Just tell me what to do and
I'll follow your lead, Jojo!

96
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:19,520
Run for your life!

97
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:23,680
Oh, man, I knew you were gonna do that!

98
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:32,760
Amon users mean nothing to me
now, but you are a special case.

99
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:38,540
This is a historic moment, and
Wamuu and ACDC must be avenged.

100
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,660
I shall celebrate my rebirth

101
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:45,820
With the utter eradication
of Joseph Joestar!

102
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:52,920
He's gaining on us! Not helping!

103
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,470
Really?

104
00:08:54,553 --> 00:08:56,857
How am I going to think of
something with you carrying on?

105
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:59,120
We've still got our dignity, Smokey!

106
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:07,340
JoJo's out there risking life and limb
to lead cars away from us. Good on you!

107
00:09:08,380 --> 00:09:11,577
But still, it is only a matter of time.

108
00:09:11,660 --> 00:09:14,980
This foe ain't one you
can beat! He's coming!

109
00:09:15,460 --> 00:09:18,166
If you're gonna think
of something, do it now!

110
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,717
Why are you running with me, anyway?

111
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:23,937
Maybe you haven't
noticed this yet, Smokey,

112
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:27,457
