You and I are good friends,

114
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:32,809
so I'll take it really badly
if you die because of me today!

115
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:36,280
For the moment, at least,
Kars is after my blood alone.

116
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,557
He thinks that killing means a
good way to wring in his new life,

117
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,857
which means that monster's
not going to stop

118
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:44,528
chasing me until I've
drawn my final breath!

119
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:49,104
Jojo, there's something
you really need to know.

120
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:53,880
Lisa, Lisa, she's more than just
some humble master. She's your...

121
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:55,860
That was fast.

122
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:58,060
Quit flapping, you son of a bitch.

123
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,380
Speed wagon, tell me,

124
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:03,960
has that pillar man really
become a perfect being?

125
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:07,040
Yes, our greatest fear has been realized.

126
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:11,660
Right in front of us, Kars has become
an unstoppable force of nature!

127
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:15,220
A perfect being is above all invincible.

128
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:18,020
That means it does not grow old.

129
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,840
It will never succumb
to death in any form.

130
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:22,210
Additionally,

131
00:10:22,293 --> 00:10:26,964
it has the abilities of all other life
forms at its disposal and outperforms them.

132
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:27,950
And finally,

133
00:10:28,033 --> 00:10:32,471
its predominant form is the standard
by which physical perfection is judged.

134
00:10:33,220 --> 00:10:35,260
We have no way to stop him now.

135
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:36,757
We've already lost.

136
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,980
He has no weaknesses at all!

137
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,060
Humans can't kill him!

138
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:45,500
Not even Hamon or the sun itself
will do a lick of good against him!

139
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:47,990
Jojo!

140
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:52,260
Sorry, but you're gonna
have to tell me later! Huh?

141
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,800
I'm kinda short on time!

142
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:57,530
Jojo!

143
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,670
Hm.

144
00:11:01,753 --> 00:11:03,000
That won't save you.

145
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,157
Ha ha!

146
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,380
You're not the only one with wings!

147
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:15,540
I'm coming for ya!

148
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:39,420
Up there!

149
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:42,140
That's one of our German warplanes!

150
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:51,060
Jojo!

151
00:12:27,900 --> 00:12:31,377
Kars mutates his feathers into
plated projectiles as hard as

152
00:12:31,460 --> 00:12:35,048
armadillo shells and coats them
with a bullet deflecting oil.

153
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:39,057
Therefore, their toughness makes
them ideal not only as shielding,

154
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:41,140
but as weapons in their own right.

155
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:52,988
Shooting those feathers
at me is dirty pool.

156
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:56,440
This doesn't look good.

157
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,539
Oh, no, you don't.

158
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:11,004
Touching down is not an option.

159
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:12,747
I've got to make my getaway.

160
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,590
JoJo!

161
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:26,110
Oh, man.

162
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:29,397
How long can he last when
all he can do is run for it?

163
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,457
Fly, boy, and don't look back.

164
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:33,880
That's all we humans can do now.

165
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:36,680
Just try to save our skins.

166
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,520
240 kilometers an hour.

167
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:48,580
I don't care how perfect
that bastard may be.

168
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:50,979
This plane has got more horsepower.

169
00:13:51,740 --> 00:13:53,060
I'm safe for now.

170
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:55,440
If he has any morning plans,

171
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:58,857
he'd better cancel them because
I'm in this for the long haul.

172
00:13:58,940 --> 00:13:59,980
Or am I?

173
00:14:01,460 --> 00:14:02,937
Two hours left.

174
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:06,608
Guess I can't give him the slip
for as long as I had thought.

175
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:08,780
You cretin.

176
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:12,780
That metal coffin of yours will
only protect you for so long.

177
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:18,020
If your plan involves landing
somewhere, I've got news for you.

178
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:22,160
The only way you'll return to
Terra Firma is in bloody chunks.

179
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:26,920
Jojo! Jojo! Do you read me?

180
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,600
This is Speedwagon over!

181
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:31,680
Hey, you guys missing me down there yet?

182
00:14:32,140 --> 00:14:33,100
Thank goodness.

183
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:36,151
Listen, you were smart to grab that plane.

184
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:41,164
I know it's not much, but the Germans and
I will do what we can to help from here.

185
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:43,660
Do you have a map?

186
00:14:45,020 --> 00:14:46,340
Yeah, found it.

187
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:47,730
Good.

188
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:51,080
Maintain radio contact, and
I'll guide you to safety.

189
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,780
Jackpot. All right.

190
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:56,236
First, give us your current position.

191
00:14:58,980 --> 00:14:59,810
What?

192
00:14:59,893 --> 00:15:00,960
Jojo, you're breaking up!

193
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:03,760
What's going on? Hey!

194
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:06,902
If you can hear me, for
the love of God, pipe up!

195
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,640
Yeah, clear as a bell.

196
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:11,897
How do you think this is gonna go? I mean,

197
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:15,497
we don't have a weapon or fighting
technique that'll work on cars worth a damn.

198
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:18,537
You were yelling about him
being immortal, remember?

199
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:19,720
Don't I know it!

200
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:23,448
You running away isn't ideal,
but it's all you can really do!

201
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,020
Hmph. Maybe not.

202
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:29,160
Looking over this map gave me an idea.

203
00:15:30,300 --> 00:15:31,260
What idea?

204
00:15:31,760 --> 00:15:34,660
Hey, Jojo, don't face Kars alone.

205
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:36,665
This is no time to act a hero.

206
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,529
He'll be too strong later.

207
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,917
This is the only time.

208
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:40,830
Don't do it.

209
00:15:40,913 --> 00:15:43,257
I forbid you to get
yourself killed out there.

210
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:44,222
Do you hear me?

211
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,940
Just listen for a second.

212
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:49,997
I know Kars is the most powerful
creature on Earth at the moment.

213
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,920
But he was born here.

214
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:54,937
Thousands of years ago,
this planet gave him life.

215
00:15:55,020 --> 00:15:58,180
And if we're lucky, it'll
take that life right back.

216
00:15:59,060 --> 00:15:59,920
Take it?

217
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:01,100
But how?

218
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:05,300
What in the world do you think
will be a threat to cars? Magma.

219
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:10,000
After all, magma's the
hottest substance on Earth.

220
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:13,282
I'll drive him into the
lava at Isola di Vulcano.

221
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,800
Even he can't survive that! No! You can't!

222
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:20,237
You've risked your neck for
humanity more than enough, boy!

223
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:22,937
Let me and the Germans do
the heavy lifting for once!

224
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:25,340
Listen to him, Jojo! Don't be stupid!

225
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:27,133
Cars is gonna kill you!

226
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:31,517
Maybe, but I'm at the
volcano, so it's too late.

227
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,180
Grip diem, as they say.

228
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,357
Mr. Speedwagon.

229
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,460
No, God, not again.

230
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:46,580
Lord Joestar, his son
Jonathan, and his son George.

231
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:51,840
The men of the Joestar family
were all cut down far too soon.

232
00:16:57,420 --> 00:17:00,597
not again why do they
always have their lives

233
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:04,817
taken don't fly into
that volcano survive for

234
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:10,937
lisa lisa's sake listen to me lisa lisa is

235
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:14,800
your mother what did you
say you're breaking up

236
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:16,630
Huh?

237
00:17:17,660 --> 00:17:19,780
That sounds like chewing!

238
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:23,320
Are you kidding me?

239
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,920
Piranhas, huh?

240
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:27,260
That's logical!

241
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:30,557
They'll eat the plane
right out from under me!

242
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,280
But how'd they get here?

243
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,600
Those feathers Coz shot before!

244
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:38,080
They turned into these damn things!

245
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,180
Buggeroll, no!

246
00:17:42,540 --> 00:17:43,757
Don't eat the parachute!

247
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:44,670
Shoot!

248
00:17:44,753 --> 00:17:45,660
You devil fish!

249
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,880
Oh, this is bad!

250
00:17:58,780 --> 00:17:59,610
Jojo!

251
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,000
What's going on?

252
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:04,240
Can you even hear me? Jojo!

253
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,140
Please, say something!

254
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,720
What a moron.

255
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:23,488
You think that parachute is your salvation,
but all it does is seal your fate.

256
00:18:23,740 --> 00:18:26,622
You're just a butterfly
caught in a spider's web.

257
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,020
Now, Jojo, time to split you asunder!

258
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:34,350
What the?

259
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:37,100
But if this is a decoy... Hmm?

260
